  (descr "Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, hot-swap socket, the hole of the socket is plated, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 6.25u (courtyard 119.01x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features. For Kailh Choc 1350 (V1) stabilizers use the _ChocV1Stab variant.")
